{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Signal the first end-hook fatal before running later hooks.** The observer is called only after the loop. If an earlier hook fails fatally and a later hook blocks while flushing, accepted async operations can start and perform side effects while the fatal signal remains unset. Notify the observer immediately on the first fatal, continue finalizing remaining plugins, then rethrow it. Test a queued worker released while a later end hook is blocked.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75xmPU","finding_digest":"0109d63564b46d62a55846e58cbcd156ed6548308be154c8ff7e94419400834a","finding_id":"arf_v1_aee5mnlewrwwfjkyi3syzpgrk3","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::fatal-signal-after-remaining-hooks","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::fatal-signal-after-remaining-hooks","line":329,"observation_digest":"e8345642e940c153fd6f7d6354c363c7394744ca971b5c7bbd67134e2913a5da","observation_id":"aro_v1_5a2fmqxjidavh7lppvrvjq3dy4","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-06T01:07:56Z","review_id":"arr_v1_buxa4o7ugg7rmklkn6vcnqh7ie","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"1ebdc9ba92eafd4373735e9cf369acf681fac4ab","reviewer":"codex","start_line":329,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_hxgrr4ziuwvrxqlukrfg4m7lqa","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T01:07:56Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
